{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu064-e-r-danyang-proposal","title":"诸葛恪请讨丹杨山民，期三年得甲士四万","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-d1fc17465b07cf0da4f5","label":"正文","text":"诸葛恪请讨丹杨山民，期三年得甲士四万；众议咸以为难，瑾闻之亦叹“恪不大兴吾家，将大赤吾族也”","evidence":["santizhu064-q-0c965afabbab3ca85bd4","santizhu064-q-d64d531c1f0569992cc5","santizhu064-q-a6d0818b24062ac7008f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0041","role":"屡请出兵丹杨并陈述三年得甲士四万之策","evidence":["santizhu064-q-0c965afabbab3ca85bd4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文纪年保留于引文；无审定公元年，不换算或推算。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-0c965afabbab3ca85bd4","santizhu064-q-d64d531c1f0569992cc5","santizhu064-q-a6d0818b24062ac7008f"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-0c965afabbab3ca85bd4","source_order":[64,31,0],"order":10932}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0041","name":"诸葛恪","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu064-q-0c965afabbab3ca85bd4","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-47c7d2a5c238ffc79849","layer":"original","quote":"恪以“丹杨山险〖2〗，民多果劲，虽前发兵，徒得外县平民而已；其余深远，莫能擒尽”。屡自求乞，为官出之〖3〗，三年可得甲士四万","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-a6d0818b24062ac7008f","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-6264e3c00282e8a949a2","layer":"original","quote":"恪父瑾闻之，亦以事终不逮〖8〗，叹曰：“恪不大兴吾家，将大赤吾族也〖9〗。”","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":32,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-d64d531c1f0569992cc5","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-73dbf7ee6dea27dfb357","layer":"original","quote":"众议咸以“丹杨地势险阻，与吴郡、会稽、新都、鄱阳四郡邻接，周旋数千里，山谷万重；其幽邃民人，未尝入城邑，对长吏〖4〗，皆仗兵野逸〖5〗，白首于林莽。逋亡宿恶〖6〗，咸共逃窜。山出铜铁，自铸甲兵。俗好武习战，高尚气力〖7〗；其升山赴险，抵突丛棘；若鱼之走渊，猿狖之腾木也。时观间隙，出为寇盗；每致兵征伐，寻其窟藏；其战〔胜〕则蜂至，败则鸟窜。自前世以来，不能羁也。”皆以为难。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":187,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
